# Citation metadata for MEF_Masonry.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MEF_Masonry, please cite the paper and the archived version of the software."
title: "MEF_Masonry: an open finite element program for block masonry in fire"
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-11"
authors:
