repository-code: "https://github.com/Niander-uenf/MEF_Masonry"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23991396"
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - masonry
  - fire
  - finite element method
  - dry-stacked masonry
  - damage mechanics
  - sensitivity analysis
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python program for the thermal and thermo-mechanical analysis of
  block masonry in fire, from the unit section to the full-scale wall: 2D and 3D
  transient heat transfer with cavity radiation, a 3D damage model with crack
  closure, dry joints with random initial gaps, transient creep, a corotational
  wall model with fibre sections, Morris screening and a browser interface.
